  <h2>Submitting events</h2>
  <p>
    Only organisers can submit events: the club, federation or company running the competition, or a person who
    officially acts for them, such as a meet director or a member of staff. We don't accept events submitted by
    participants, fans or other third parties. If you know of a competition that's missing, you're welcome to tell us at <a
      href="mailto:info@proswimworkouts.com">info@proswimworkouts.com</a
    >, and we'll look into it.
  </p>
  <p>When you submit an event, you confirm that:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>you organise the event, or officially act for its organiser;</li>
    <li>the event is a real swimming competition, in the pool or open water;</li>
    <li>the details are correct to the best of your knowledge, and you'll tell us if they change;</li>
    <li>
