  </p>
  <p>Submitting events is free. If we add paid features later, they will have their own terms, shown before you pay.</p>

  <h2>Claiming an event we added</h2>
  <p>
    If you organise an event that is already on the site, you can claim it instead of submitting it again. Once we've
    verified that you're the organiser, the event is linked to your account, so you can keep it up to date. We check
